WEBVTT

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.880
Hello, student. This video is based on how to submit your assignment or minor project through

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:22.540
Google Classroom. Step one, how to join Google Classroom. You will be receiving an email

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:28.440
from Launched Global via Classes Air Launched. Orgain. Now, just click on Join Now. Kindly

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:33.360
note that you need to join with a personal email ID. Now, you will be receiving this pop-up.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.500
Just click on Join. Successfully, you have joined the opted domain Google Classroom.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.600
Step two, how you will get the assignment. You will be receiving an email from the

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.980
Mentor side. Just scroll down the email and click on See Detail button. Now, you will

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:53.680
be directed to the Google Classroom where the work has been assigned. Step three, how to

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:58.100
submit the assignment. After completing the assignment, in the top right corner, you will

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:05.560
have the option called Add or Create. Click on that. Now, click on Files. Click on Browse

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:10.460
and just upload the assignment file. At last, click on Hand In Button to submit the assignment.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:15.780
That's it. This is how to submit the assignment in the Classroom. If you face any issue,

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.400
please contact the support email.

